WEBVTT

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.790
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:19.240
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.580
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.040
spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.040
Kasel and his friends arrive
at the Forest of Elidora

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.490
to find the key to unsealing
the Holy Sword Aea.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.240
Guided by Selene, the elven princess,

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.450
they travel to their meeting
with Lorraine, a Great Sage.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.660
On their way, they encounter a Demon,

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.080
and a treant child loses his life.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:54.790
You!

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.580
Master Lorraine...

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:38.950
<i></i>The Power of

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:38.950
<i></i>the Holy Sword

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.160
Master Lorraine...

00:02:54.160 --> 00:03:00.950
Kasel, everyone, I want to thank you
for saving the Forest of Elidora.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.950
On behalf of everyone here,
I offer my sincerest gratitude.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:10.160
Please don't... I...

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.290
I couldn't protect Chibi...

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:18.790
He was a treant with more
curiosity than any other.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:24.120
I'm sure he was very happy
to have spent time with you.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:31.990
Life is a cycle. It returns to the earth,
sprouts, and continues the lineage...

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:34.160
There is no need to be so concerned.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.240
Selene, you also did well.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:40.200
Thank you...

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:45.580
You came here for one specific reason.
Is that right, Kasel?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:50.540
Yes. I come before you to ask you
to unseal the Holy Sword Aea.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:55.240
This one is the heir to the Holy Sword...?

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.990
Unfortunately, I cannot
unseal it right this moment.

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:03.740
What?! We came all the way out here
because Dominix told us to!

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:08.700
The moment I undo the seal,
if you truly are the heir,

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.540
the power of the Holy Sword
will begin to flow into you.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:16.990
However, are you truly worthy of that power?

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:21.240
I need the power, Master Lorraine!

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.700
The power of the Holy Sword is so strong,
it can even defeat the Dark Lord.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.580
If it is not wielded properly...

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:35.370
Kasel, it could destroy you, both body and soul.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.040
I don't care what happens to me...

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:44.330
I need power! To protect those dear to me!

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:48.870
Kasel, I understand how you feel.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:52.950
However, it's very late already.
Let us continue talking tomorrow.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.200
This is Master Lorraine's residence.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.950
Please rest here for tonight.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.790
Excuse me...

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.240
Yes?

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:18.990
I'd like to bury Chibi...

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.160
Necha?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:25.490
Yes. I'd like to bury him in
his favorite spot, if he had one.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:27.990
In that case...

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:37.450
He liked to play here.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:39.120
I see.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.790
Let's let him rest here.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:41.740
Yes...

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:43.540
Let me help.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:08.330
It was fun, Chibi.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:11.870
I won't forget meeting you, Chibi.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.740
Selene, let's talk.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:33.200
I thought she'd undo the seal
right away once we arrive at the forest...

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:37.830
I'm sure Master Lorraine has her reasons.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.040
Are you all right, Kasel?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.200
Yeah...

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.290
I'm going to step out for a moment.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:51.540
Um... What is it that you wish to discuss?

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:56.490
Selene, how did Kasel appear to you?

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.490
How...?

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:04.080
Do you think he is worthy of earning
the power of the Holy Sword Aea?

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.160
I don't know.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.660
I see.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:11.040
Why are you asking me that?

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:13.790
I wanted your opinion.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:18.080
My... My opinion is not...

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:23.700
You, Selene, are the one
that spent time with him,

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:26.790
and got to see his personality directly.

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.830
Please, tell me.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:38.950
I... don't know.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:44.790
I see. Please put some thought into this.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:46.120
Yes...

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:58.790
What does Master Lorraine want from me...?

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.620
The heir to the Holy Sword...

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.200
Is Kasel the heir to King Kyle,

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:11.040
who fought the Dark Lord with
Master Lorraine 100 years ago?

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:18.910
But... does Kasel have whatever King Kyle had
that draws others to follow him?

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:25.120
A man who lets himself get lost in anger
must surely be headed towards demise.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.580
I can't...

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:40.790
Chibi... I'm so sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.830
I did defeat that Demon...

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.160
But...

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.580
All I did was lose myself in anger.

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:55.410
It was just dumb luck that the Demon
was defeated in the process.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.660
That's not the power I need.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.990
If this goes on, I...

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.870
I want to be stronger...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.950
What's this...?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.790
It's a treant sprout.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:30.450
When treants die,
they receive a new life, like this.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.120
This is Chibi...?

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:37.910
But... so quickly?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.080
It's unbelievable.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:45.660
Perhaps Necha is trying to cheer us up.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:51.040
Thank you... Chibi...

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:57.540
I... I will become stronger!

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:06.580
Have you had enough rest?

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.830
Yes.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.700
Before we go on to the main topic...

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:14.620
Selene, have you reached
a conclusion from last night?

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:15.180
Yes.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:16.450
What's that about?

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:17.620
Who knows?

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:22.990
Until now, I believed humans are destroyers,

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.790
a threat to all lives in the forest.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.990
A selfish existence with no self-control.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:33.240
But Kasel and his companions here
rushed to help the Forest of Elidora

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:39.080
the moment they saw the Demon,
with no regard for their own safety.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:43.580
That is not consistent with
my belief of how humans are.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:47.240
Why weren't you able to answer me last night?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:55.620
I wasn't sure. True, Kasel did defeat the Demon.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:11:01.830
But when Kasel lost Necha,
he appeared to have lost control of himself.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:05.660
Flailing his power around...

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:10.120
If a human like that gained power,
he may use it against the Forest of Elidora

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:15.200
in the near future. That's what I feared.

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:18.740
But no, he understood.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:24.870
He knew that what he felt then was
not true power. Yet, he still seeks power.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:31.740
Master Lorraine, I think Kasel is worthy
of inheriting the power of the Holy Sword.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.580
That is my conclusion.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:37.950
And I'm sure Necha agrees.

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.990
Thank you, Miss Selene.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:45.910
No, I... I'm just stating the truth.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:52.330
Selene, it seems the walls in your heart
against humans have come down a little.

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:02.580
I've already told you what
the Holy Sword's powers are like.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.700
Are you sure your feelings are still unchanged?

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:06.950
Yes!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.180
Kasel has us.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:21.370
Yeah.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:26.290
Yeah, if something goes wrong,
my magic will go boom on Kasel!

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:32.200
King Kyle also had the help of
his many friends to cut open his path...

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:38.120
You resemble King Kyle.
I suppose you will go your father's way.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.240
Selene.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.450
Yes.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:45.950
In the past, the humans and I
fought alongside each other.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:49.410
Under our common goal,
to defeat the Dark Lord...

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:54.950
Difference in race was not an impediment at all.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.740
Master Lorraine...

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:05.160
Now, I will undo the seal on the Holy Sword Aea.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:03.830
Yes, you are indeed the heir to the Holy Sword.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.700
Wait, that's it?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.290
How is it? Did anything change?

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:15.290
Do you feel strength filling up inside you,
or do you feel the urge to kick some butt?

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:18.240
Nothing, really.

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:25.040
You will find out soon enough.
You will feel the power.

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.040
Yes!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:30.620
Well, I guess that's one seal taken care of.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:34.450
There are two more locks on this seal.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:40.450
One is with Aeatola, the leader of
the Orcs in the Ogria Mountain...

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:43.950
And the other is with Pavel,
in the Windland Snow Mountain,

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:47.120
that is even further away than Ogria Mountain.

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.830
Visit these two.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:54.120
Yes, Master Lorraine.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.540
Come on, let's get moving!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:57.620
Yeah!

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.790
This feeling... Demons!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.370
How?!

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.200
We defeated that one already.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:28.950
I heard some Demons can survive
by leaving behind a seed when they die!

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.870
How tenacious.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.580
I won't forgive you!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.660
Selene...

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.120
Just watch.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.830
Kasel!

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:54.240
He's completely different from yesterday...!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.120
Nice!

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:02.040
Vengeance for... Chibi!

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.580
Thank you again for all of your help.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:19.240
Unseal and acquire the Holy Sword.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:24.450
You will be supported by many allies
and their bonds with you.

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.660
Yes!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.040
Kasel.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:36.120
I... I can't honestly say
I trust all humans yet. But...

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:40.700
Kasel, I trust you and your friends.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.200
Thank you, Miss Selene.

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:54.200
See you again soon, Chibi!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:09.080
Hah, those fools, they came crying for help!

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:14.040
They want the Black Edge to defeat
the Demons in the King's Forest alone.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:17.990
They seem to prefer to keep
their own knights close at hand.

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:21.330
It would be to our benefit
to have them owe us a favor now.

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:25.330
This is a great opportunity
to advance towards your knighthood.

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:30.080
Gaining the rank of knight, wouldn't that be
an unfathomable good fortune for you?

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:35.620
We the Black Edge would never
forget our gratitude to you.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:42.950
Of course. I am only letting you gain power
to silence those nagging politicians.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:48.490
I want you to perform feats
more impressive than the knights.

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:51.080
I will lay the groundwork for you.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:54.580
Yes, understood.

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:08.240
You could have gone with them, don't you think?

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:14.580
No, I... I must protect the Forest of Elidora...

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.870
Yes, of course.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.540
But...

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:32.120
We're finally out of the forest!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:37.910
First goal, Ogria Mountain.
But it's still quite a distance away.

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:41.660
There are towns and villages along the way.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:44.660
Let's gather information there as we move on.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:49.240
Shouldn't the Orc settlement where
Master Aeatola is be pretty easy to find?

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:53.490
We need to rest and resupply, too.
Do you want to walk non-stop?

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.240
Oh, right.

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:59.160
I wonder if the heroes from
100 years ago travelled like this, too?

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:02.290
I think back then it was more like a war.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:05.700
It might have been more like
an army of knights marching.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.200
King Kyle was the king, after all.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:12.240
If times were different,
Kasel would be a prince, right?

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:14.370
Maybe it isn't too late to let everyone know.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:19.040
I don't intend to. I'm just me.
Just regular Kasel.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.160
Yeah, makes sense.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:24.410
King Kyle's son, an apprentice knight?
Not cool at all.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.660
It makes sense to hide it.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:31.290
Kasel is a person from the past, after all.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:42.200
None of that matters to us. Kasel is Kasel.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.490
Yes.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:44.540
Anyway, let's go.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:45.870
Yes.

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.540
Hello again, boy.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.410
You're...!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:06.740
What immense magic power...

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.620
Let us through.

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:10.990
Here she comes!

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.200
Oh, good effort.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:29.330
So you have friends this time?

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:32.080
And you don't have your Demons with you?

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.660
They have nothing to do with me.

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:38.700
You... What do you want?!

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.410
I just want to play.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:59.740
What...? This power...

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:10.410
Yes... I feel the power of
the Holy Sword from you.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:21.450
Kyle is supposed to be the only one
who can use the Holy Sword...

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:24.240
It's no surprise that he can use it!

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:27.950
Kasel is King Kyle's son!

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:29.540
What are you talking about?

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:33.740
But still... The power of
the Holy Sword is real.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.660
The Holy Sword is Lua's Curse.

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.910
Will you become Lua's puppet as well?

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:47.450
Huh...?

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:52.200
With our travel budget depleted,
we decided to find work to do.

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:56.620
Cleo rediscovers the terrible power
her magic can have,

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:00.830
and recalls her mother's words
from a long time ago.

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.880
<i></i>Maven

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.880
<i></i>of Fire
